OL,3,GNEWSAStray cat Lottie produces unusual
OL,4,Alitter of nine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rescue cat has given birth to nine
OL,7,Fkittens - one of the biggest litters
OL,8,Fthe RSPCA's Bridlington branch has seen
OL,9,Fin years.
OL,11,FThree-year-old Lottie and her offspring
OL,12,F- five males and four females - are
OL,13,Fbeing cared for at a cattery run by the
OL,14,FRSPCA's Bridlington, Driffield and
OL,15,FDistrict Branch.
OL,17,FTypically, a cat has four to six kitten
OL,18,Fin a single litter, according to the
OL,19,FRSPCA.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
