OL,3,GNEWSAStray cat Lottie produces unusual
OL,4,Alitter of nine
OL,5,
OL,6,FCattery manager Sophie Gibbon-Roles
OL,7,Fsaid: "For now, Lottie's whole world is
OL,8,Fthese nine little faces and we're
OL,9,Fhelping her to keep them warm, clean,
OL,10,Ffed and safe."
